.TH tkudateentry n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkudateentry
.PP
Date entry with a drop\-down calendar picker: an entry showing a date plus a button that drops down a month grid of day buttons (Monday\-first) with previous/next navigation, \fBToday\fR and \fBClear\fR. The displayed text uses \fB\-dateformat\fR; \fBgetDate\fR always returns the ISO date. Date math uses \fBclock\fR.
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkudateentry::widget .d ?-dateformat fmt? ?-width n? \
        ?-textvariable var? ?-command cmd?]
::tkutils::tkudateentry::getText  $w        ;# entry text (formatted)
::tkutils::tkudateentry::getDate  $w        ;# ISO yyyy-mm-dd, or "" if empty/invalid
::tkutils::tkudateentry::setDate  $w iso    ;# set from ISO date ("" clears)
::tkutils::tkudateentry::today    $w
::tkutils::tkudateentry::clear    $w
.CE
.PP
\fB\-command\fR is called with the ISO date (or "" on Clear) when a day is picked. \fBsetDate\fR rejects non\-ISO input with error code \fB{TKUTILS TKDATEENTRY DATE}\fR.
